# [重要] 生成物・一時ファイル・機密の除外設定
# 理由: 再生成できる成果物や実行時データを Git 管理すると、差分ノイズや誤コミットが増えるため。

# Node / frontend
node_modules/
dist/
.env
certs/
logs/

# PlatformIO / ESP32
.pio/
IoT/ESP32/.pio/
IoT/ESP32/src/Untitled
IoT/ESP32/sdkconfig.defaults
IoT/ESP32/data/sensitiveData.json

# LocalServer generated data
IoT/LocalServer/data/secure-backups/
IoT/LocalServer/data/securityState.json
IoT/LocalServer/data/wrapped_*.bin
IoT/LocalServer/public/assets/images-pack.zip
IoT/LocalServer/data/wifi-profiles/*.xml
IoT/LocalServer/scripts/wifi-profile-*.xml
IoT/LocalServer/tmp/

# ProductionTool / SecretCore / C# build outputs
IoT/ProductionTool/target/
IoT/SecretCore/target/
csharp/**/bin/
csharp/**/obj/

# Workspace helper data
.serena/
IoT*.zip

# C/C++ build outputs
*.obj
*.exe
